<title>HONG KONG: GOLF-ALFRED DUNHILL MASTERS FIRST ROUND SCORES. [CORRECTED 11:53 GMT]</title>
<headline>GOLF-ALFRED DUNHILL MASTERS FIRST ROUND SCORES. [CORRECTED 11:53 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first round scores in</p>
<p>the $500,000 Alfred Dunhill Masters golf tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>63 Paul Devenport (New Zealand) (Corrects first name)</p>
<p>64 Kang Wook-soon (South Korea)</p>
<p>65 Gerry Norquist (U.S.)</p>
<p>66 Aaron Meeks (U.S.), Scott Laycock (Australia), Bernhard</p>
<p>Langer (Germany), Bradley Hughes (Australia), Park No-seok</p>
<p>(South Korea)</p>
<p>67 Hsieh Yu-shu (Taiwan), Tsai Chi-huang (Taiwan), Boonchu</p>
<p>Ruangkit (Thailand), Scott Taylor (U.S.), Darren Cole</p>
<p>(Australia)</p>
<p>68 Thammanoon Sriroj (Thailand), Felix Casas (Philippines),</p>
<p>Michael Harwood (Australia), Lee Joon-suk (South Korea),</p>
<p>Jyoti Rhandhawa (India), Choi Sang-ho (South Korea)</p>
<p>Other selected scores:</p>
<p>69 Colin Montgomerie (Scotland)</p>
<p>71 Ernie Els (South Africa), Seve Ballesteros (Spain)</p>
</text>
